  "notes": "Baiso is written in the Ge'ez script. The 1st order is mapped to 'e' and 4th order to 'a', reflecting common Cushitic orthographic practices. The 6th order is mapped to the bare consonant. Ejectives are transcribed with U+02BC modifier letter apostrophe. The voiced velar stop is represented by U+0261.",
